  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve the growth of agribusiness and rural finance through provision of investment to innovative private sector initiatives in South Sudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity To improve the growth of agribusiness and rural finance through provision of investment to innovative private sector initiatives in South Sudan is a component of Africa Enterprise Challenge Fund (South Sudan) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xA3;2,453,386. It works in the following sector(s): Agricultural development, Formal sector financial intermediaries, Small and medium-sized enterprises (SME) development.</narrative>
  </description>
